root = true

[*]
charset = utf-8
end_of_line = lf
insert_final_newline = true
trim_trailing_whitespace = true

[*.{cpp,h,hpp,c,cc,cxx}]
indent_style = tab
indent_size = 4
tab_width = 4

[*.{json,xml,yml,yaml}]
indent_style = space
indent_size = 2
```

**Why this matters:**
- Works across VS Code, Visual Studio, and other editors
- GitHub respects it when displaying code
- Team members automatically get the right settings

## Step 4: Tell Git to Handle Tabs Properly

**Create/edit `.gitattributes` in your project root:**
```
# Ensure consistent line endings
* text=auto

# C++ source files
*.cpp text
*.h text
*.hpp text
*.c text
*.cc text
*.cxx text

# Keep tabs in source files
*.cpp filter=
*.h filter=
*.hpp filter=